BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Crip Tonite
DTSTART:20260808T200000
DTEND:20260808T200000
UID:55b1ea7a1cadbedef7567a1fe77f42c1@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:It’s time for a night of disability drag and burlesque at CR
 IPtonite! As part of this year’s Disability Arts Festival\, you can catc
 h a series of boundary-defying performances on Saturday\, August 8th\, fro
 m 8 PM - 10PM at Tarragon Theatre. Experience the incredible talent and cr
 ip joy these performers have to offer\, all situated in an accessible and 
 relaxed environment on Saturday. CRIPtonite will feature ASL interpretatio
 n\, live audio description\, and open captions. Tickets are available in a
  pay-what-you-can format. Get yours through the link in our bioor at thedi
 sabilitycollective.com/tickets. We can’t wait to see you there! ACCESS M
 EASURES: - Deaf interpretation\, audio description\, and captions will be 
 provided at both the in-person show and on the livestream. -A quiet space 
 will be available for folks to take a break from the show. Sensory and fid
 get toys will be provided. - Access and venue guides are available on our 
 website. - Masks will be required for all audience members\, artists\, vol
 unteers\, and staff but may be removed temporarily for drinking and eating
 . Masks will be required in any public spaces in the venue\, including the
  lobby and washrooms. Exemptions are always made for medical and access re
 asons. Air purifiers supplied by Safe Air Collective will be on in the lob
 by and theatre spaces. ‍
LOCATION:Tarragon Theatre Mainspace\, 30 Bridgman Ave
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/crip-tonite
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
