BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Toronto Leatherqueer Picnic
DTSTART:20260815T140000
DTEND:20260815T140000
UID:8fd3134cd1f8e9280c8b856d200c4bde@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Leatherqueer Picnic Saturday August 15th\, 2-5pm. *If 
 it’s raining\, we’ll reschedule for another time. This is a space for 
 leatherqueers of marginalized genders to connect\, make friends\, and crui
 se. Flagging is encouraged! We will have optional name tags and icebreaker
  prompts to help folks mingle comfortably. We’ll gather in the southwest
  corner of the park\, near Banjara. Look for the Leather Pride flag to fin
 d us! This spot in the park is mixed sun and shade and has flat\, uneven g
 rassy ground. If you like\, bring yourself a camp chair\, picnic blanket\,
  pillow\, snacks\, whatever you’d like to have to enjoy a nice afternoon
  in the park. Let’s be comfortable! A note on C0v1D: the limited data we
  have makes it difficult to assess the severity of this ongoing pandemic. 
 Let’s practice caring safety protocols and give each other ample space. 
 Bring a mask in case you want to get closer to skill-share or cruise etc. 
 *If someone is wearing a mask\, wear one to approach them.* If you have an
 y symptoms of illness or known/suspected recent exposures\, please don’t
  come. Let’s make sure we have a healthy tomorrow to meet again in the f
 uture. Christie Pits is at 750 Bloor St W in Toronto. It is accessible by 
 car with street and lot parking nearby\, by subway via Line 2 at Christie 
 station and by bus via route 126. There are two\, gendered\, wheelchair-ac
 cessible washrooms at the bottom of a steep hill with a paved path. Your o
 rganizers are @hollys_horny_home @pansybutch &amp\; @thekikikennedy. Inspi
 red by similar gatherings across turtle island\, with acknowledgement &amp
 \; appreciation to @mother.archetype &amp\; @_wolfsmilk._ .\, @monster_fem
 me\, @sharonpinkishere\, @chicagoleatherdykepicnic\, and many others. ‍
LOCATION:Christie Pits Park\, 750 Bloor Street West
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/toronto-leatherqueer-picnic-5
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
