 electronic music\, LMNL Sessions is a concert series designed to take audi
 ences on sonic journeys across genres\, cultures\, people\, and generation
 s. Each edition brings together artists who are redefining the sound of th
 e SASWANA region\, creating space for discovery\, connection\, and communi
 ty on and off the dancefloor. For Vol. 1\, we&#x27\;re travelling across I
 ndia\, Bangladesh\, and Tunisia\, featuring a lineup that bridges generati
 ons of artists! From the legendary Discostan\, celebrating 15 years of gro
 undbreaking work decolonizing the dance floor\, to a new wave of phenomena
 l talent with Dameer\, Rou-H\, and Sär\, each pushing the needle through 
 innovative edits\, original productions\, and live vocals. Line Up: Discos
 tan Dameer Rou-H Sār Expect an immersive summer evening filled with nosta
 lgic tunes\, intertwined with forward-thinking sounds\, beautiful curation
 \, and the kind of musical discoveries that stay with you long after the n
 ight ends. ‍
