 \, but what about the trans-mascs? We bring you…DOLLZ+DOGZ: A Wet T4T-Sh
 irt Contest to bring the entire trans community together for a day on the 
 beach. Gathered at Hanlans Point\, we’ll do we do best – live life lux
 uriously\, and look phenomenal while doing it! More than that\, we’ll ta
 ke up space in the sun celebrating trans bodies\, existence and community.
