DESCRIPTION:Toronto’s drag queen of comedy\, VIZA\, records her sophomor
 e album Exhausted Showgirl LIVE at Comedy Bar Bloor Expect an evening of V
 IZA’s signature style: witty stand-up\, celebrity roasting\, and cultura
 l commentary only she can deliver VIZA has been dazzling audiences across 
 Canada with her sharp wit and even sharper tongue for over 18 years. She
 ’s been featured on JFL Toronto\, JFL Vancouver\, CBC Gem\, CRAVE\, and 
 Sirius XM. In February 2026\, she was selected to be a cast member of Seas
 on 7 of CBC’s New Wave Of Stand-up\, making history as the first drag qu
 een to achieve this honour. She’s been fortunate enough to work with and
  open for multiple touring acts including Caroline Rhea\, James Adomion\, 
 Nico Carney\, Kevin Sullivan\, and Michael Henry Tickets are $20 plus tax 
 in advance\, $25 plus tax at the door. A portion of each ticket will be do
 nated to Gilda’s Club Of Toronto Stick around post show for VIZA’s bir
 thday bash at Comedy Bar! ‍
LOCATION:Comedy Bar\, 945 Bloor Street W
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/exhausted-showgirl-comedy-album-recording
